cli-ask (0.3.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add continuous interactive chatbot mode (ask --chatbot, ask -i) with REPL.
  * Add interactive output splitter line separating user queries from AI responses.
  * Enforce terminal-native plain text formatting without unrendered markdown.
  * Modularize codebase into config, session, client, updater, and chatbot units.
  * Pipe-safe output suppression when stdout or stderr is redirected.

 -- Mugunthan <mugunth13@proton.me>  Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:00:00 +0800

cli-ask (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add in-place self-updater command (ask --update-self).
  * Fix Windows file-lock during in-place binary replacement.
  * Improve installation docs and package discovery.

 -- Mugunthan <mugunth13@proton.me>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0800

cli-ask (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add interactive multiline EOF entry mode (Ctrl+D / Ctrl+Z).
  * Improve flag disambiguation and literal command argument handling.
  * Support POSIX '--' argument separator.

